DESCRIPTION:Join us for a Sexual Assault Awareness tabling event focused o
 n education\, prevention\, and support. Stop by to learn about consent\, 
 healthy relationships\, bystander intervention\, and resources available 
 to survivors. Attendees can explore educational materials\, participate i
 n interactive activities\, and learn ways to help create a safer and more
  supportive campus community.\nEveryone is welcome to stop by\, ask quest
 ions\, pick up resources\, and show their support for sexual assault awar
 eness and prevention.\n\nHosted by: Omega Psi Phi Fraternity\, Inc.\n\nAd
 ditional Information can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/even
 t/12871368
DTEND:20261012T160000Z
DTSTAMP:20261010T053119Z
