DESCRIPTION:Test Your Safety Smarts! 🧪✨\nThink you know what a poison loo
 ks like? You might be surprised! Stop by our interactive tabling event to
  learn how to keep yourself and your roommates safe on campus. The Indian
 a Poison Center will discuss common (yet sneaky) hazards—from tricky look
 -alike products and everyday medication mix-ups to common poisonings and 
 prevention tips. \n\nHosted by: IU Student Health Center\n\nAdditional In
 formation can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12819612
