 nce of art\, community\, and cultural traditions.\nAll Indiana University
  events\, groups\, activities\, and educational\, cultural\, and historic
 al observances welcome all IU students and other members of the Indiana U
 niversity community.\n\nHosted by: First Nations Educational and Cultural
  Center\, Indiana Memorial Union Board\n\nAdditional Information can be f
 ound at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12825325
