DESCRIPTION:Once associated with older generations\, Mahjong has now found
  a new home among the young. Social clubs have emerged dedicated to playi
 ng Mahjong to reconnect with culture and\, more importantly\, to foster n
 ew friendships. At the ACC\, we offer a casual and informal Mahjong exper
 ience\, perfect for those looking to learn the game\, take a break from t
 he digital world\, and most importantly\, meet new friends in person. You
  do not need to be an expert to join us\, just bring your enthusiasm and 
 a willingness to learn!\n \nAll Indiana University events\, groups\, acti
 vities\, and educational\, cultural\, and historical observances welcome 
 all IU students and other members of the Indiana University community.\n\
 nHosted by: Asian Culture Center\n\nAdditional Information can be found a
 t: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12470846
DTEND:20261012T220000Z
DTSTAMP:20261010T053119Z
DTSTART:20261012T200000Z
LOCATION:Asian Culture Center (807 E 10th street\, Bloomington\, IN)
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Asian Cultures Around Campus: Mahjong Mondays
UID:https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12470846
URL:https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12470846
X-HOSTS:Asian Culture Center
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:IU beINvolved Student Orgs
CATEGORIES:ThoughtfulLearning
CATEGORIES:Social Event
DESCRIPTION:\nImprove your English-speaking skills and learn from native s
 peakers who are eager to share their knowledge of the language. \n\n\nSes
 sions focus on topics like slang\, holidays\, and American culture in gen
 eral. No reservations are necessary—stop by and join us anytime. We meet 
 twice a week during the semester on Mondays and Wednesdays. For Fall 2026
 \, PET will begin on September 16th\, with all sessions held in-person at
  the Ferguson International Center\, Room 423.\nIs English your first lan
 guage? Have you been speaking it so long that it may as well be? Become a
  tutor and help international students at IUB become more comfortable wri
 ting\, reading\, and speaking English. Engage in IU’s global network and 
 make connections that last a lifetime.\nYou can also sign up to practice 
 your conversational English skills as a participant. Register and join th
 e email list HERE. \n\n\nHosted by: \n\nAdditional Information can be fou
 nd at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12670133
DTEND:20261012T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20261010T053119Z
DTSTART:20261012T220000Z
LOCATION:Ferguson International Center
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CANCELLED
SUMMARY:Practical English Tutorials (PET)
UID:https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12670133
URL:https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12670133
END:VEVENT
