CATEGORIES:Intellectual Wellness
CATEGORIES:Campus-Wide Event
DESCRIPTION:Join us for food and fun at Bridgework\, a monthly leadership 
 and team-building series designed to helps students strengthen their abil
 ity to collaborate in their organizations and communities.\nWhether you'r
 e leading a student org\, supporting a team\, or just getting started\, B
 ridgework offers practical tools and powerful insights to help you build 
 better bridges—between people\, ideas\, and action.\n \n📅 October 14th\,
  2026⏰ 6:00 PM – 8:30 PM📍 IMU Club Hub\n \nThe last 30 minutes of this e
 vent will be dedicated to student leader training for those attending to 
 fulfill their 2026 Student Leader Summit requirements. Students attending
  for this purpose must attend the full event in addition to these 30 minu
 tes to receive credit.\n \nBridgework Takeovers\nIs your student organiza
 tion looking for a specific topic to be covered during one of our eight s
 essions? Suggest a topic by emailing hwienke@iu.edu. A takeover does not 
 make your workshop exclusive to your group but it does make it more custo
 mized to your group's needs. Takeovers are exclusive to one group per Bri
 dgework event and include: choice of topics and choice of activities and 
 games. \nOctober Takeover Group: Unclaimed\n \nAll Indiana University eve
 nts\, groups\, activities\, and educational\, cultural\, and historical o
 bservances welcome all IU students and other members of the Indiana Unive
 rsity community.\n\nHosted by: Indiana Memorial Union\, Student Involveme
 nt and Leadership\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://bein
 volved.indiana.edu/event/12630405
DTEND:20261015T003000Z
DTSTAMP:20261010T053119Z
DTSTART:20261014T220000Z
LOCATION:IMU Club Hub
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Bridgework Series: October
UID:https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12630405
URL:https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12630405
X-HOSTS:Student Involvement and Leadership
END:VEVENT
