DESCRIPTION:Join us for lunch and the Leadership Compass Series\; a twice-
 a-month comprehensive leadership development workshop designed to help st
 udents grow competency across the 8 domains of the Student Leadership Com
 petencies.\nWhether you're new to leadership or already involved on campu
 s\, the Leadership Compass offers practical tools and meaningful conversa
 tions to elevate your leadership journey.\n📅 October 15th\, 2026⏰ 12:00 
 PM – 2:30 PM📍 IMU Club Hub\n \nThe last 30 minutes of this event will be
  dedicated to student leader training for those attending to fulfill thei
 r 2026 Student Leader Summit requirements. Students attending for this pu
 rpose must attend the full event in addition to these 30 minutes to recei
 ve credit.\nAll Indiana University events\, groups\, activities\, and edu
 cational\, cultural\, and historical observances welcome all IU students 
 and other members of the Indiana University community.\n\nHosted by: Indi
 ana Memorial Union\, Student Involvement and Leadership\n\nAdditional Inf
 ormation can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12629335
DTEND:20261015T183000Z
DTSTAMP:20261010T053119Z
DTSTART:20261015T160000Z
