 mbers towards writing resources\, provide prompts\, share works\, and mor
 e! During select general meetings\, we may also bring in guest speakers o
 r host special events related to writing.\nWriter’s Place also offers wee
 kly fiction and poetry workshops for peer review and publishes our own ye
 arly lit journal. \nNew members or first-time attendees are always welcom
