CATEGORIES:Social
DESCRIPTION:\nEver find yourself talking about something you're way too pa
 ssionate about? Now's your chance to share your Roman Empire with everyon
 e! Join us for a fun and lighthearted PowerPoint Night where you can talk
  for a couple of minutes about any topic of your choice! It could be a ra
 ndom obsession\, a niche interest\, a funny theory\, a controversial opin
 ion\, or literally anything you find interesting. PowerPoints are encoura
 ged but not required! You can present in German or English\, but we highl
 y encourage you to give German a try to practice your language skills in 
 a fun\, low-pressure environment. To kick things off\, 6 German Club boar
 d members will be presenting their own mini PowerPoints and sharing some 
 of their favorite topics. Not interested in presenting? No worries! Feel 
 free to come\, sit back\, listen\, and enjoy everyone else's presentation
 s. Whether you want to share your Roman Empire or just watch and have a g
 ood time\, everyone is welcome!\nNo pressure\, just good vibes\, mini pre
 sentations\, and a little German practice!\n\nHosted by: German Club at I
 U\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.e
 du/event/12855752
DTEND:20261015T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20261010T053119Z
DTSTART:20261015T210000Z
LOCATION:Global & International Studies\, GA 3170
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:PowerPoint Night
UID:https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12855752
URL:https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12855752
X-HOSTS:German Club at IU
END:VEVENT
