 ientific concepts in a creative\, accessible\, and visually engaging way.
  No prior STEM background is required!\nAll Indiana University events\, g
 roups\, activities\, and educational\, cultural\, and historical observan
 ces welcome all IU students and other members of the Indiana University c
 ommunity.\n\nHosted by: Indiana Memorial Union Board\n\nAdditional Inform
