DESCRIPTION:Dr. Faraz Harsini—biomedical scientist and founder of Allied S
 cholars for Animal Protection—is visiting IU's campus on October 22nd as 
 part of his 2026 national tour. Hear Dr. Faraz's personal journey from bi
 omedical research to full-time animal rights activism\, alongside a hard 
 look at the realities of the meat and dairy industries. He will systemati
 cally break down common marketing tactics\, separate industry myths from 
 facts\, and explore the unique\, powerful role college students play in d
 riving this movement forward.\n\nHosted by: Allied Scholars for Animal Pr
 otection at Indiana University\n\nAdditional Information can be found at:
  https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12858865
DTEND:20261022T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20261010T053119Z
DTSTART:20261022T213000Z
