LOCATION:Geological Sciences\, GY 1050
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Meat: The Truths and The Lies with Dr. Faraz Harsini
UID:https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12858865
URL:https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12858865
X-HOSTS:Allied Scholars for Animal Protection at Indiana University
