DESCRIPTION:Boy in the Bubble offers an EXTREMELY sophisticated night of h
 igh-brow college humor. Our shows consist of original sketches (think SNL
  but worse) and usually run about an hour. Bring your friends and join us
  as we engage in this brutal public humiliation ritual for your entertain
 ment. We can't wait to see your smiling faces this semester!\n\nHosted by
 : Boy in the Bubble Comedy\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: htt
 ps://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12565303
